<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2YOH 64 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya cibili ya Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yohane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya cibili ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata ya Yohane yacibili yalalembwa ne mutumwa Yohane mucaka ca (90 A.D.) Yohane nkalasansululungeti ewalalemba kalata iyi, nomba walikuweti ni mutangunishi. Bilimo mukalata ya Yohane yacibili byakoshanako ne bisa bili mu Mulumbe Waina wa Yohane. Ici cilaliboneshenga pakubweshela sha mulawo wa kusunana ne pakukoshanisha sha lusuno ne kukonka milawo yakendi 2 Yohane 1:5-6. Caboneketi iyi kalata Yohane walailembela pamo ne Mulumbe Waina wa Yohane ne makalata naambi, yakutanguna ne yacibili ne yacitatu pa cindi ncali kuba ku Efenso. Yohane walalembela kalata iyi kuli uyo mutukashi wasaliwa pamo ne banabendi. Nomba wali kulembela ku mubungano pamo ne basaliwa bonse abo bashoma. Yohane ncalikuyanda ni kuyumisha mubungano ne kubacenjesha pacebo ca beshi kwiyisha bandemishibili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane layambanga kalata pakwamba nkwelenga nekubapa mitende bene kalata 2 Yohane 1:7-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane layumishinga mubungano ne kubanusha sha mulawo walusuno lunene 2 Yohane 1:4-6</para>
  <para style="io1">Cishikukonkapo, labacenjeshenga sha beshikwiyisha bandemi shibili 2 Yohane 1:7-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane lapwishinga ne kubalaya cena 2 Yohane 1:12-13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ame mutangunishi ndalembelenga mutukashi wasalwa ne Lesa, kayi ne bana bendi abo mbonsuni. Lino ntame ndenka nkusuni, nsombi ne abo bonse basuni cakubinga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tumusuni pacebo cakubinga ico cili mulinjafwe, kayi ceti cibenganga mulinjfwe kwa cindi conse. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lesa Bata ne Yesu Klistu Mwanendi, atupe lumuno ne luse kayi ne lumuno lube nenjafwe mu cakubinga ne mu lusuno.</para>
  <para style="s">Cakubinga ne Lusuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndalakondwa cancine ncine mpondalacaneti bana benu nabambi bali mubwikalo bwakukonka cakubinga mbuli Bata ncobalatwambila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino ndakusengenga omutukashi obe wasunika kwambeti twense tusunane. Nteko kwambeti ndakulembele mulawo umbi, nsombi niwopele usa ngotwalikukute kufuma pakutatika. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lusuno ndondambanga nilwakwambeti tukonkelenga Milawo ya Lesa mbuli ncomwalanyumfwa kufuma kumatatikilo, neco twelela kusunana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga bandemi shibili bangi balesulu mucishi capanshi conse, nabo nkabalasumininga kwambeti Yesu walesa mbuli muntu. Bantu bamushobo uyu nibandemi shibili kayi nibalwani ba Yesu Klistu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco cenjelani kwambeti mutataya ico ncomwalasebensela kwambeti mukatambule cilambo cenu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uliyense labulunga kukonkela kwiyisha kwa Yesu Klistu nsombi kabikilapo nabimbi, nkalipo ne Lesa. Nsombi uyo lasungunga ciyisho ico emuntu uli ne Lesa kayi ne Yesu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco muntu wisa kulinjamwe kwisa akwiyisha bintu byabula kuba mbuli ibi, mutakamutambula mung'anda mwenu, kamutakambeti, “lumuno lube nenjobe.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga uliyense lamupanga mitende lasuminishinga bwipishi bwakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkute bintu binga byakukwambila nsombi nkansuni kubilemba munkalata. Ndayeyenga kwisa akukufwakashila, kwambeti nkamwambile katuli twalangana, kayi ne kwambeti tukasangalale cancine ncine. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bana bankashi yakobe basalwa balakupanga mitende.</para>
</usx>
